      "narration": "How can a rocket climb into space, where there isn't even any air?",
      "on_screen_text": "How does a rocket fly?",
      "highlight_words": [
        "rocket"
      ],
      "sfx": "impact",
      "transition": "cut"
    },
    {
      "id": "s2",
      "role": "development",
      "type": "scene3d",
      "model3d": "coh_balloon",
      "narration": "Think of a balloon: let it go, and the air rushes out one way while the balloon shoots off the other.",
      "on_screen_text": "Like a balloon",
      "highlight_words": [
        "balloon"
      ],
      "sfx": "whoosh",
      "transition": "cut"
    },
    {
      "id": "s3",
      "role": "development",
      "type": "scene3d",
      "model3d": "coh_newton",
      "narration": "A rocket does the same: it blasts gas downward at enormous speed, and that gas pushes it up.",
      "on_screen_text": "Action and reaction",
      "highlight_words": [
        "reaction"
      ],
      "sfx": "riser",
      "transition": "cut"
    },
    {
      "id": "s4",
      "role": "development",
      "type": "scene3d",
      "model3d": "coh_vacuum",
      "narration": "It doesn't need air to push against: that's why it works just as well in the vacuum of space.",
      "on_screen_text": "Works without air",
      "highlight_words": [
        "air"
      ],
      "sfx": "none",
      "transition": "cut"
    },
    {
      "id": "s5",
      "role": "development",
      "type": "scene3d",
      "model3d": "coh_tanks",
      "narration": "But it does need oxygen to burn its fuel, so it carries its own in a tank.",
      "on_screen_text": "It brings its own oxygen",
      "highlight_words": [
        "oxygen"
      ],
      "sfx": "pop",
      "transition": "cut"
    },
    {
      "id": "s6",
      "role": "development",
      "type": "scene3d",
      "model3d": "coh_mass",
      "narration": "So much that about ninety percent of a rocket's weight at liftoff is propellant.",
      "on_screen_text": "90% propellant",
      "highlight_words": [
        "90%"
      ],
      "sfx": "none",
      "transition": "cut"
    },
    {
      "id": "s7",
      "role": "development",
      "type": "scene3d",
      "model3d": "coh_stages",
      "narration": "That's why it goes in stages: when a tank runs dry, it drops off so it isn't carrying dead weight.",
      "on_screen_text": "Stages that drop off",
      "highlight_words": [
        "Stages"
      ],
      "sfx": "whoosh",
      "transition": "cut"
    },
    {
      "id": "s8",
      "role": "development",
      "type": "scene3d",
      "model3d": "coh_orbit",
      "narration": "To stay in orbit it has to go about twenty-eight thousand kilometers per hour: it's actually falling around the Earth nonstop.",
      "on_screen_text": "Orbit: endless falling",
      "highlight_words": [
        "falling"
      ],
      "sfx": "ding",
      "transition": "cut"
    },
    {
      "id": "s9",
      "role": "surprise",
      "type": "scene3d",
      "model3d": "coh_land",
      "narration": "And today some rockets come back, brake with their engines and land upright to be used again.",
      "on_screen_text": "Rockets that land!",
      "highlight_words": [
        "land!"
      ],
      "sfx": "impact",
      "transition": "cut"
    },
